DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     Each device has a quiet flag associated with it.  A device is verbose by
     default when it is created but may be quieted to prevent printing of the
     device identification string during attach and printing of a message dur‐
     ing detach.  To quiet a device, call ddeevviiccee__qquuiieett() during a device
     driver probe routine.  To re-enable probe messages, call
     ddeevviiccee__vveerrbboossee().  To test to see if a device is quieted, call
     ddeevviiccee__iiss__qquuiieett().

     Devices are implicitly marked verbose after a driver detaches.

